mkstemp\n  disposition: atomic-sibling\n  rationale: Worker runtime output uses an atomic sibling before publication.\n- identity: tools/check_coverage.py::collect_counts::tmpdir\n  path: tools/check_coverage.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Coverage collection creates local fixture projects for test-only measurement.\n- identity: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py::exercise_control_plane_helper_scenarios::temp_dir\n  path: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py\n  symbol: temp_dir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Coverage helper scenarios create isolated test projects only.\n- identity: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py::exercise_install_provenance_helper_scenarios::temp_dir\n  path: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py\n  symbol: temp_dir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Coverage helper scenarios create isolated test projects only.\n- identity: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py::exercise_install_tool_helper_scenarios::temp_dir\n  path: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py\n  symbol: temp_dir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Coverage helper scenarios create isolated test projects only.\n- identity: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py::exercise_support_sync_helper_scenarios::temp_dir\n  path: tools/check_coverage_extra_lib.py\n  symbol: temp_dir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Coverage helper scenarios create isolated test projects only.\n- identity: tools/eval_issue_scenarios.py::run_issue_sibling_search_concept_fixtures::tmpdir\n  path: tools/eval_issue_scenarios.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Evaluation scenarios create local fixture repositories only.\n- identity: tools/eval_setup.py::run_setup_inspect_states::tmpdir\n  path: tools/eval_setup.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Setup evaluation scenarios create local fixture repositories only.\n- identity: tools/eval_setup.py::run_setup_inspect_states::tmpdir#2\n  path: tools/eval_setup.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Setup evaluation scenarios create local fixture repositories only.\n- identity: tools/eval_setup.py::run_setup_inspect_states::tmpdir#3\n  path: tools/eval_setup.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Setup evaluation scenarios create local fixture repositories only.\n- identity: tools/eval_setup.py::run_setup_operator_acceptance_synthesis::tmpdir\n  path: tools/eval_setup.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Setup evaluation scenarios create local fixture repositories only.\n- identity: tools/run_evals.py::expect_adapter_bootstrap::tmpdir\n  path: tools/run_evals.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Eval adapter bootstrap checks use isolated local fixture directories only.\n- identity: tools/run_evals.py::scenario_quality_bootstrap_posture::tmpdir\n  path: tools/run_evals.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Eval bootstrap scenarios use isolated local fixture directories only.\n- identity: tools/validate_packaging_committed.py::main::tmpdir\n  path: tools/validate_packaging_committed.py\n  symbol: tmpdir\n  disposition: test-compatibility-only\n  rationale: Packaging validation uses a local temporary fixture workspace only.\n",
